-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data and services
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

The agronomic coefficients, climate observations, soil predictions, elevation
models, satellite imagery and map tiles used by Sillon are provided by their
respective owners under their own terms:

  - NASA POWER (Langley Research Center) — CC BY 4.0
  - NASA GIBS / MODIS Terra — NASA open data policy
  - ERA5 / CMIP6 via Open-Meteo — Copernicus licence
  - SoilGrids (ISRIC) — CC BY 4.0
  - USGS 3DEP / SRTM — public domain
  - OpenStreetMap contributors — ODbL
  - Google Maps Platform — Google terms of service
  - Groq (LLM inference) — Groq terms of service

Sillon is an independent submission to the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 and
is not endorsed by NASA. NASA data is used, not modified, and every figure in
the report is either computed by the engine or labelled with its source.
